# --- pipeline/ -------------------------------------------------------------
# The retrieval engine is a second npm package inside this repo: its own
# package.json, its own dependencies, its own install. `node_modules` and `.env`
# above match at any depth, but these need naming explicitly.

# The Kaggle source CSV for Tier 2 (11.7MB). Re-downloadable, and its licence is
# unchecked for redistribution — pipeline/ARCHITECTURE.md says so. The derived
# pipeline/data/dishes.json is what the code actually reads, and is committed.
